# 77 Projects App Initialization Reference

## Description

This document serves as a **reference guide** for understanding the Next.js project structure used in 77-projects. All files documented here are automatically created by the `budi-kit new` command - you do not need to manually create them.

**Note:** This is a reference document, not an execution guide. The project generator handles all file creation automatically.

## Prerequisites

- Node.js 18+ installed
- pnpm package manager installed (`npm install -g pnpm`)
- Git installed and configured

